# `overrides = true` on a `:bom` line forces every pin of the BOM (minus `bomOverridesFilter` and the modules the
# project declares itself); on a dependency line it forces that revision. Plain lines add nothing.
> assertNotOverridden
> assertOverridden
> assertFiltered
> assertPinned

# The BOM forces jackson-databind 2.17.0 below the 2.17.2 jackson-module-scala requires: `LoweringCheck.Error` fails
# `update`, `LoweringCheck.Off` skips the check, and projects without overrides are never affected.
> set optin / dependencyOverridesLoweringCheck := LoweringCheck.Error
-> optin/update
> set optin / dependencyOverridesLoweringCheck := LoweringCheck.Off
> optin/update
> set myproject / dependencyOverridesLoweringCheck := LoweringCheck.Error
> myproject/update
